{"unit_id":"xiaohj233__dsh-resume#card-zh","repo":"xiaohj233/dsh-resume","commit":"bafcdd75a3ed648c2e71446d7a6585fe3727bb7a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-resume 是面向 DSH Web profile 的会话续接插件。它通过 host 插件追踪运行中的会话，并为 agent-loop、session 和 conversation composer 应用兼容补丁，将中断时已生成的文本与推理折叠进会话记录。用户可用空输入继续未完成的对话，也可在 DSH 重启后自动恢复之前运行的会话和子代理；工具还可手动重试中断的子代理。客户端会显示每次请求和每轮生成所用的模型。适合需要跨中断或重启继续 DSH 工作的人；需要兼容的 DSH Web profile，不需额外配置密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:99-101","lib/index.js:315-381","lib/index.js:468-519","client.js:99-110"]}
{"unit_id":"xiaohj233__dsh-resume#card-en","repo":"xiaohj233/dsh-resume","commit":"bafcdd75a3ed648c2e71446d7a6585fe3727bb7a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-resume continues interrupted DSH Web sessions. It retains partial reasoning, resumes a turn on empty send or Enter, and restores sessions and subagents after restart. A tool retries subagents; the client displays model labels. Requires a compatible Web profile.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:99-101","lib/index.js:315-381","lib/index.js:468-519","client.js:99-110"]}
