{"unit_id":"xiaohj233__dsh-resume#feature-partial-turn","repo":"xiaohj233/dsh-resume","commit":"bafcdd75a3ed648c2e71446d7a6585fe3727bb7a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-resume 的「中断内容保留」功能：流式生成被停止时，将已经收到的文本和推理内容折叠为 assistant 消息，保留在会话历史中。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/patch.js:169-180","lib/patch.js:285-322"]}
{"unit_id":"xiaohj233__dsh-resume#feature-empty-continue","repo":"xiaohj233/dsh-resume","commit":"bafcdd75a3ed648c2e71446d7a6585fe3727bb7a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-resume 的「空输入续接」功能：在 Web 对话中对中断的会话按发送或 Enter，以空文本提示继续生成，不插入可见的继续消息。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:54-95","lib/index.js:371-381"]}
{"unit_id":"xiaohj233__dsh-resume#feature-boot-restore","repo":"xiaohj233/dsh-resume","commit":"bafcdd75a3ed648c2e71446d7a6585fe3727bb7a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-resume 的「启动恢复」功能：启动后读取先前记录的运行会话，在 loader 稳定并等待配置延迟后逐个恢复；失败项保留以便下次启动重试。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:391-435","lib/index.js:521-539"]}
{"unit_id":"xiaohj233__dsh-resume#feature-subagent-tool","repo":"xiaohj233/dsh-resume","commit":"bafcdd75a3ed648c2e71446d7a6585fe3727bb7a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-resume 的「恢复中断子代理」功能：工具 resume_interrupted_subagents 会尝试重启待恢复的子代理，并返回成功结果与仍待重试的会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:468-519"]}
{"unit_id":"xiaohj233__dsh-resume#feature-model-labels","repo":"xiaohj233/dsh-resume","commit":"bafcdd75a3ed648c2e71446d7a6585fe3727bb7a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-resume 的「模型标记」功能：在会话流中显示每次请求及每轮回答所用的模型；已知时也显示 reasoning effort。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:99-110","client.js:121-187","client.js:213-253"]}
